title: >-
  Analysis code for: Clinical Free-Text Retrieval Across an Acute
  Physiological Derangement Composite in Intensive Care Unit Discharge
  Summaries
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the
  manuscript it accompanies.
