license: MIT
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-21"
keywords:
  - clinical natural language processing
  - information retrieval
  - text embeddings
  - subgroup performance
  - MIMIC-IV
abstract: >-
  Code to reproduce a stratified evaluation of whether known-item retrieval
  performance over ICU discharge summaries varies across strata of an early
  physiological derangement composite measured independently of the text.
  Thirteen transformer encoders and a BM25 baseline are evaluated against a
  single pooled index, with alternative explanations, alternative query draws,
  an age-free exposure and a lab-only organ-dysfunction exposure. Contains no
  patient data; MIMIC-IV and MIMIC-IV-Note must be obtained from PhysioNet under
  their own data use agreements.
